# Gate-level estimate of the Tagma decoder.
#
# Maps the synthesized design to a small 2-input gate library and reports
# the cell count behind the "~300 gates" claim. The count is an estimate:
# the library is not a real PDK standard cell library. The OpenROAD flow
# in Phase 4 replaces this with a Sky130 report.

read_verilog -sv ../../rtl/tagma_decoder.v
hierarchy -check -top tagma_decoder
proc
flatten
opt
techmap
opt
abc -g AND,NAND,OR,NOR,XOR,XNOR
tee -o reports/gates_stat.txt stat
write_verilog out/tagma_decoder_gates.v
